              "text": "рейс (reys) — \"a flight; a trip (of a bus or a ship)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Наш рейс в два часа дня. Nash reys v dva chasá dnya. Our flight is at two in the afternoon."
            },
